one-time | Combines whiteboard + 2D animation. More flexible but steeper learning curve. |\n\n---\n\n## How to Recreate This — Step by Step\n\n### The Production Pipeline (Based on vidIQ's Analysis)\n\n```\nScri\n<truncated 1784 bytes>\nssets** | Search stock sites (1-2 hrs) | AI image gen → vectorize with Vectorizer.io (30 min) |\n| **Animation** | VideoScribe manual timeline (3-4 hrs) | VideoScribe still manual (3-4 hrs) — no AI shortcut here yet |\n| **Music** | Search library (30 min) | Suno generates custom track (5 min) |\n| **Final edit** | Premiere/DaVinci (1 hr) | Same (1 hr) |\n| **TOTAL** | **10-12 hrs** | **5-7 hrs** |\n\n### Tools Stack (Complete)\n\n| Purpose | Tool | Cost |\n|---------|------|------|\n| Animation | **VideoScribe** | $99/year |\n| Script assistance | Claude/ChatGPT | Free-$20/month |\n| Voiceover | **ElevenLabs** | Free tier or $5/month |\n| SVG assets | Flaticon + The Noun Project | Free/freemium |\n| Video editing | **DaVinci Resolve** | Free |\n| Background music | **Suno